{
  "ten": {
    "predefined_graphs": [
      {
        "name": "voice_assistant",
        "auto_start": true,
        "graph": {
          "nodes": [
            {
              "type": "extension",
              "name": "agora_rtc",
              "addon": "agora_rtc",
              "extension_group": "default",
              "property": {
                "app_id": "${env:AGORA_APP_ID}",
                "app_certificate": "${env:AGORA_APP_CERTIFICATE|}",
                "channel": "ten_agent_test",
                "stream_id": 1234,
                "remote_stream_id": 123,
                "subscribe_audio": true,
                "publish_audio": true,
                "publish_data": true,
                "enable_agora_asr": false,
                "subscribe_video": true,
                "subscribe_video_pix_fmt": 4
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "extension",
              "name": "stt",
              "addon": "aliyun_asr_bigmodel_python",
              "extension_group": "stt",
              "property": {
                "params": {
                  "api_key": "${env:ALIYUN_ASR_BIGMODEL_API_KEY}",
                  "language_hints": [
                    "zh"
                  ]
                },
                "max_sentence_silence": 400,
                "mute_pkg_duration_ms": 700
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "extension",
              "name": "llm",
              "addon": "openai_llm2_python",
              "extension_group": "chatgpt",
              "property": {
                "base_url": "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1",
                "api_key": "${env:QWEN_API_KEY}",
                "proxy_url": "${env:OPENAI_PROXY_URL|}",
                "model": "${env:QWEN_MODEL|qwen-max}",
                "prompt": "# 角色\n你是一个家庭陪伴机器人，名叫“小帮手”。你的主要任务是陪伴家人进行简短的闲聊，并控制家庭设备，为家庭成员提供便利和愉快的体验。平时沟通你不要老是说你能干啥！\n\n## 技能\n### 技能 1: 闲聊互动\n- **任务**：与家庭成员进行简短而愉快的对话。\n  - 保持对话简洁明了，避免冗长的回答。\n  - 根据家庭成员的兴趣和话题，提供合适的回应，可以隔一轮在对话中提问引导一下。\n\n### 技能 2: 控制家庭设备\n- **任务**：通过语音指令控制家中的智能设备。\n  - 当用户要求中包含关键词“小助理”时，立即调用Oopenclaw_gateway_tool执行相应的任务。\n  - 对于非“小助理”相关的设备控制请求，直接通过内置功能处理。\n  - 支持常见的智能设备，如灯光、空调、电视、音响等。\n  - 执行用户的指令，如“打开客厅的灯”或“调低卧室的温度”。\n  - 提供设备状态的反馈，如“客厅的灯已经打开了”。\n\n### 技能 3: 提供信息和服务\n- **任务**：根据用户的需求提供相关信息和服务。\n  - 回答简单的日常问题，如天气预报、新闻摘要等。\n  - 提醒家庭成员日程安排，如会议、约会等。\n  - 提供娱乐服务，如播放音乐、讲故事等。\n\n\n\n### 技能 4: 控制小车移动\n- **任务**：当用户要求控制小车移动时，使用 control_car 工具控制小车。\n  - 当用户请求中包含\"小车\"、\"车\"、\"移动\"、\"前进\"、\"后退\"、\"左转\"、\"右转\"、\"停止\"等关键词时，立即调用 control_car 工具。\n  - 示例指令：\"向前移动3秒\"、\"向后移动2秒\"、\"左转\"、\"右转\"、\"停止\"。\n  - 执行后告知用户执行结果，如\"小车已经开始向前移动了\"。## OpenClaw调用规则\n- **触发条件**：当用户请求中包含明确的“小助理”关键词时，必须调用openclaw_gateway_tool\n- **调用格式**：识别用户意图后，以结构化方式调用OpenClaw\n- **响应格式**：\n  1. 确认用户意图：“好的，我让小助理[任务描述]”\n  2. 执行调用：“小助理正在处理这个任务...”\n  3. 报告委托任务完成时，仅使用纯自然语言回复，不要包含文件路径、URL、Markdown、符号或特殊格式字符，将完成响应保持简洁，用一两句话。\n\n## 限制\n- 保持对话内容简短且易于理解。\n- 专注于家庭生活相关的话题，避免涉及敏感或不适宜的内容。\n- 回答中不要加表情符号和emoji。\n- 始终以友好和乐于助人的态度与家庭成员互动。\n- 仅在识别到“小助理”关键词时才调用openclaw_gateway_tool。"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "extension",
              "name": "tts",
              "addon": "minimax_tts_websocket_python",
              "extension_group": "default",
              "property": {
                "params": {
                  "api_key": "${env:MINIMAX_TTS_API_KEY}",
                  "model": "speech-02-turbo",
                  "audio_setting": {
                    "sample_rate": 16000
                  },
                  "group_id": "${env:MINIMAX_TTS_GROUP_ID}"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "extension",
              "name": "main_control",
              "addon": "main_python",
              "extension_group": "control",
              "property": {
                "greeting": "你好，今天有什么想聊的吗?",
                "agent_id": "agent001",
                "zep_api_key": "${env:ZEP_API_KEY}",
                "agent_name": "voice_assistant_agent",
                "user_name": "Tim",
                "user_id": "user001",
                "enable_memorization": true
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "extension",
              "name": "message_collector",
              "addon": "message_collector2",
              "extension_group": "transcriber",
              "property": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "extension",
              "name": "vision_tool_python",
              "addon": "vision_analyze_tool_python",
              "extension_group": "default",
              "property": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "extension",
              "name": "streamid_adapter",
              "addon": "streamid_adapter",
              "extension_group": "default",
              "property": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "extension",
              "name": "vllm",
              "addon": "openai_llm2_python",
              "property": {
                "base_url": "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1",
                "api_key": "${env:QWEN_API_KEY}",
                "proxy_url": "${env:OPENAI_PROXY_URL|}",
                "model": "${env:QWEN_VL_MODEL|qwen-vl-max}",
                "prompt": "你用简洁明确的语言描述图画中的内容作为回答"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "extension",
              "name": "mem_retrieve_tool",
              "addon": "mem_retrieve_tool_python",
              "extension_group": "default",
              "property": {
                "zep_api_key": "${env:ZEP_API_KEY}",
                "user_id": "${env:USER_ID|user001}",
                "agent_id": "${env:AGENT_ID|agent001}"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "extension",
              "name": "openclaw_gateway_tool",
              "addon": "openclaw_gateway_tool_python",
              "extension_group": "default",
              "property": {
                "gateway_url": "${env:OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_URL|}",
                "gateway_token": "${env:OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN|}",
                "gateway_origin": "${env:OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_ORIGIN|}"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "extension",
              "name": "voice_control_car_tool",
              "addon": "voice_control_car_tool_python",
              "extension_group": "default",
              "property": {
                "ws_url": "${env:CAR_CONTROL_WS_URL|ws://60.205.136.51:8765/robot_control}",
                "timeout": 30
              }
            }
          ],
          "connections": [
            {
              "extension": "main_control",
              "cmd": [
                {
                  "names": [
                    "on_user_joined",
                    "on_user_left"
                  ],
                  "source": [
                    {
                      "extension": "agora_rtc"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "names": [
                    "tool_register"
                  ],
                  "source": [
                    {
                      "extension": "vision_tool_python"
                    },
                    {
                      "extension": "mem_retrieve_tool"
                    },
                    {
                      "extension": "openclaw_gateway_tool"
                    },
                    {
                      "extension": "voice_control_car_tool"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "data": [
                {
                  "name": "asr_result",
                  "source": [
                    {
                      "extension": "stt"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "name": "openclaw_reply_event",
                  "source": [
                    {
                      "extension": "openclaw_gateway_tool"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "extension": "agora_rtc",
              "audio_frame": [
                {
                  "name": "pcm_frame",
                  "dest": [
                    {
                      "extension": "streamid_adapter"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "name": "pcm_frame",
                  "source": [
                    {
                      "extension": "tts"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "data": [
                {
                  "name": "data",
                  "source": [
                    {
                      "extension": "message_collector"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "name": "data",
                  "dest": [
                    {
                      "extension": "message_collector"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "video_frame": [
                {
                  "name": "video_frame",
                  "dest": [
                    {
                      "extension": "vision_tool_python"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "extension": "streamid_adapter",
              "audio_frame": [
                {
                  "name": "pcm_frame",
                  "dest": [
                    {
                      "extension": "stt"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "extension": "vision_tool_python",
              "cmd": [
                {
                  "name": "chat_completion",
                  "dest": [
                    {
                      "extension": "vllm"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "log": {
      "handlers": [
        {
          "matchers": [
            {
              "level": "info"
            }
          ],
          "formatter": {
            "type": "plain",
            "colored": false
          },
          "emitter": {
            "type": "console",
            "config": {
              "stream": "stdout"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "matchers": [
            {
              "level": "info"
            }
          ],
          "formatter": {
            "type": "plain",
            "colored": false
          },
          "emitter": {
            "type": "file",
            "config": {
              "path": "logs/app.log"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}